{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00910","headline":"鼓吹曲辞 鼓吹铙歌 靖本邦 · 柳宗元","name":"鼓吹曲辞 鼓吹铙歌 靖本邦","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"本邦伊晋，惟时不靖。\n根柢之摇，枝叶攸病。\n守臣不任，勩於神圣。\n惟钺之兴，翦焉则定。\n洪惟我理，式和以敬。\n羣顽既夷，庶绩咸正。\n皇谟载大，惟人之庆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳宗元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00910.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00910","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}